{
    "title": "Swagbucks Trivia for Money",
    "description": "Swagbucks Daily Trivia is a free app where you can play trivia games for real money and win $1000s every week. \r\n\r\nPlay addictive, live trivia games daily and get free PayPal cash, gift cards to Amazon and other popular stores.\r\n\r\nTwo ways to play games and earn money with Swagbucks LIVE:\r\n\r\n1. Join the LIVE trivia game show and answer 10 daily questions. Play trivia with players from all over the world. Share a mega prize pot with other players and score special SB bonuses. All the excitement of real-time, live-stream play.\r\n\r\nEvery weekday, Swagbucks broadcasts live trivia games. Play at 8p EST Monday - Thursday\r\n\r\n2. Play a round of daily trivia at ANY TIME of day. Play games and earn money whenever you want. Answer the 10 questions correctly and win cash money and gift cards. With this exciting NEW FEATURE, there's no need to wait for the live game show.\r\n\r\nWhether you love a mind-bending challenge or enjoy doing trivia to relax, Swagbucks Daily Trivia is a fun way to flex your brain and test your general knowledge. \r\n\r\nSwagbucks Daily Trivia is fun and ultra awesome: \r\n- NO COST. Completely free to play real trivia games and earn real money. \r\n- NO BOREDOM. Fun, engaging questions on various topics like famous people, geography, sports, movies, history, and general knowledge. \r\n- REAL REWARDS. Since 2008, Swagbucks has paid over $780 million in cash and gift card rewards to users for playing Swagbucks LIVE and completing other earning activities in the Swagbucks app and on Swagbucks.com. \r\n- Over 7,000 gift cards for Amazon, Target, Walmart, Home Depot, and other popular stores are redeemed every single day. \r\n\r\n* Prizes are paid to winners through SB points, redeemable for popular gift cards or PayPal cash at swagbucks.com/redeem.\r\n\r\nThe Swagbucks Daily Trivia app is similar to other popular trivia game show apps:\r\n- Millionaire Trivia\r\n- Trivia Crack\r\n- Sphinx Trivia\r\n- Trivia STAR\r\n\r\nBut Swagbucks Daily Trivia offers more prize choices and other activities to earn on Swagbucks.com and in the Swagbucks surveys app. And unlike other trivia apps, on Swagbucks Daily Trivia, it is free to play cash games and win cash prizes. \r\n\r\nGet Swagbucks Daily Trivia now. Play trivia games for real money.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Swagbucks Daily Trivia is a free app where you can play trivia games for real money and win $1000s every week. <br><br>Play addictive, live trivia games daily and get free PayPal cash, gift cards to Amazon and other popular stores.<br><br>Two ways to play games and earn money with Swagbucks LIVE:<br><br>1. Join the LIVE trivia game show and answer 10 daily questions. Play trivia with players from all over the world. Share a mega prize pot with other players and score special SB bonuses. All the excitement of real-time, live-stream play.<br><br>Every weekday, Swagbucks broadcasts live trivia games. Play at 8p EST Monday - Thursday<br><br>2. Play a round of daily trivia at ANY TIME of day. Play games and earn money whenever you want. Answer the 10 questions correctly and win cash money and gift cards. With this exciting NEW FEATURE, there&#39;s no need to wait for the live game show.<br><br>Whether you love a mind-bending challenge or enjoy doing trivia to relax, Swagbucks Daily Trivia is a fun way to flex your brain and test your general knowledge. <br><br>Swagbucks Daily Trivia is fun and ultra awesome: <br>- NO COST. Completely free to play real trivia games and earn real money. <br>- NO BOREDOM. Fun, engaging questions on various topics like famous people, geography, sports, movies, history, and general knowledge. <br>- REAL REWARDS. Since 2008, Swagbucks has paid over $780 million in cash and gift card rewards to users for playing Swagbucks LIVE and completing other earning activities in the Swagbucks app and on Swagbucks.com. <br>- Over 7,000 gift cards for Amazon, Target, Walmart, Home Depot, and other popular stores are redeemed every single day. <br><br>* Prizes are paid to winners through SB points, redeemable for popular gift cards or PayPal cash at swagbucks.com/redeem.<br><br>The Swagbucks Daily Trivia app is similar to other popular trivia game show apps:<br>- Millionaire Trivia<br>- Trivia Crack<br>- Sphinx Trivia<br>- Trivia STAR<br><br>But Swagbucks Daily Trivia offers more prize choices and other activities to earn on Swagbucks.com and in the Swagbucks surveys app. And unlike other trivia apps, on Swagbucks Daily Trivia, it is free to play cash games and win cash prizes. <br><br>Get Swagbucks Daily Trivia now. Play trivia games for real money.",
